        <mxCell id="sAc8dC_QL7qjKVBoc4Ot-33" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Private Subnet EC2 instance (request to download Nginx package) -&amp;gt; The request checks the route table -&amp;gt; It finds an entry saying 0.0.0.0/0 -&amp;gt; Nat Gateway -&amp;gt; The request reaches Nat Gateway (Ec2 instance with a public IP) -&amp;gt; Suppose Nat Gateway is in Private Subnet - &lt;b&gt;How will it reach the internet?&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
